6. The listed Non - Convertible Debentures of the Company aggregating to Rs. 32,549.80 crores as on June 30, 2026 are secured by way of an exclusive charge on identified standard assets of the Company . The total asset cover is above one hundred percent of the principal amount of the said debentures. &lt;br /&gt; 
 &lt;br /&gt; 
7. The Company had on October 05, 2023 allotted 2,00,000, 7.5% Compulsorily Convertible Debentures (CCDs) of face value Rs. 1,00,000/- each to eligible qualified institutional buyers at an Issue Price of Rs. 1,00,000/- per CCD. Further, pursuant to the placement document, the CCDs have an early conversion option on or after September 30, 2025. Up to June 30, 2026, 1,37,000 CCDs were converted into 98,74,127 equity shares. &lt;br /&gt; 
